{"summary":"石肝是一种色如肝脏的矿物药材，味酸无毒，主治皮肤瘙痒，具有美容养颜的功效。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"《别录》曰︰味酸，无毒。主身痒，令人色美。生常山，色如肝。","translation":"据《别录》记载：石肝味酸，没有毒性。主治身体瘙痒，能使人容颜美丽。产于常山，颜色像肝脏一样。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#石肝","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}